@startuml test-drive-states
!include style.iuml
hide empty description
left to right direction

state "Created" as Created
state "Approved" as Approved
state "Completed" as Completed
state "Canceled" as Canceled

[*] --> Created : client books
Created --> Approved : manager approves
Approved --> Completed : manager completes
Completed --> [*]
Created -[norank]-> Canceled : client or manager
Approved -[norank]-> Canceled : client or manager
Canceled --> [*]
@enduml
